  "version": "0.16.0-alpha.1",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.1 - 2026-06-16\n\n### Features\n\n- Add Homebrew 6.0+ trust instructions so macOS Homebrew installs no longer fail at the untrusted tap step (#1078)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent the same copied image from being repeatedly saved and synced on some Linux desktops, and keep the storage limit enforced during long sessions (#1083)\n- Restore Snap package builds so Linux users can install the Snap package again (#1075)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.1 - 2026-06-16\n\n### Features\n\n- 补充 Homebrew 6.0+ 的 tap 信任步骤，避免 macOS 用户通过 Homebrew 安装时卡在未信任 tap 报错上 (#1078)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复部分 Linux 桌面上同一张已复制图片被反复保存和同步的问题，并让长时间运行时的存储上限持续生效 (#1083)\n- 恢复 Snap 安装包构建，让 Linux 用户可以再次安装 Snap 包 (#1075)",
